      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It'd also be cool if the person you failed to join got a message like \"Your friend [name] tried to join you, but the room was full.\" so they know what's going on as well.  Could be a problem for someone trying to bring in a lot of friends or streamers or something, though.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-04-09T18:53:47.305Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As other people have already mentioned, it would be great if you could click on the world your friend is in to see the instance as that would show how many people are in the instance and how much space is left. It is also very hard to tell when a friend has joined in big worlds or game worlds and it can be difficult to tell them so or to even notice them. It is also hard to figure out why you were unable to join a friend of yours. The notification system needs to tell the user that the instance was full, the world is only for friends, and other information like this to prevent confusion going forward.",
